00:40:41,589 --> 00:40:50,230
risk assessment right so I always think of it as probability impact and detectability that's always like the formula of how you do risk assessment so

372
00:40:50,230 --> 00:40:58,470
I think about how probable do I think it is that AI will do something wrong or will do it right however I want to think about it and

