00:42:02,470 --> 00:42:09,589
I care about for this particular application and for this change that I'm doing so in a sense the trust gets built because

385
00:42:09,589 --> 00:42:19,190
of your trust and also your harness in a sense right yeah yeah yeah we just now have to find out like how far can we push these harnesses and again it might depend on the use case right and

