00:47:03,910 --> 00:47:08,390
But I don't think it's the same thing because a large language model is not a compiler.

435
00:47:08,390 --> 00:47:14,710
A compiler is repeatable, deterministic to like very very high nines.

436
00:47:14,710 --> 00:47:21,990
So, and a large language model is very semantic, interpretative, probabilistic, all of those types of things.

